WEBVTT

00:00:04.630 --> 00:00:08.710
Lunch break is over, so why am I this sleepy?

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:10.040
<b>For Unzen-sensei's use</b>

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:10.040
<b>Oranges</b>

00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:15.500
Since I have an air-like presence, I should be able
take a nap during class without anyone noticing.

00:00:15.960 --> 00:00:18.420
Or that's what I thought up until now.

00:00:19.790 --> 00:00:23.040
My seat neighbor, Kubo-san, can see me.

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:26.670
She's asleep.

00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:31.500
It's unusual for Kubo-san to sleep during class.

00:00:47.210 --> 00:00:48.580
Shiraishi-kun.

00:00:48.580 --> 00:00:49.290
Huh?

00:00:50.380 --> 00:00:51.540
Good morning.

00:00:52.540 --> 00:00:53.880
G-good mo-

00:00:55.960 --> 00:00:57.460
Oh, she fell back asleep already.

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:35.170
<b>Episode 2: Bad Luck and Home Visit</b>

00:02:35.170 --> 00:02:37.920
<b>Drip   drip   drip...</b>

00:02:35.540 --> 00:02:37.540
That long-distance race wore me out.

00:02:35.540 --> 00:02:36.000
<b>Wheeze</b>

00:02:36.540 --> 00:02:37.080
<b>Wheeze</b>

00:02:37.540 --> 00:02:37.920
<b>Wheeze</b>

00:02:38.880 --> 00:02:42.790
When I run with a big group of people,
my partner loses sight of me.

00:02:43.130 --> 00:02:44.460
Mizuhara-kun!

00:02:45.500 --> 00:02:46.830
I'm crossing the finish line!

00:02:47.130 --> 00:02:50.130
I have to announce myself when I cross the finish line.

00:02:47.750 --> 00:02:49.130
Oh! All right!

00:02:51.460 --> 00:02:56.330
It's honestly rough. I'm no athlete, so I'm mentally
and physically put through the wringer.

00:02:56.920 --> 00:02:57.920
<b>Wheeze</b>

00:02:57.420 --> 00:02:59.880
But I have to or my time won't be recorded.

00:02:57.670 --> 00:02:58.630
<b>Pant</b>

00:02:57.670 --> 00:02:58.630
<b>pant</b>

00:02:58.420 --> 00:02:59.420
<b>Wheeze, wheeze</b>

00:02:59.750 --> 00:03:00.630
<b>Wheeze</b>

00:03:00.420 --> 00:03:00.920
<b>Pant</b>

00:03:00.420 --> 00:03:00.920
<b>pant</b>

00:03:01.210 --> 00:03:02.790
Oh, Shiraishi-kun!

00:03:04.420 --> 00:03:05.420
Hi there!

00:03:05.630 --> 00:03:07.500
So the boys are done now too?

00:03:08.130 --> 00:03:09.040
Kubo-san.

00:03:13.790 --> 00:03:14.210
<b>Slide</b>

00:03:14.750 --> 00:03:16.500
Um... Huh?

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:18.920
Oh, it's just that I'm really sweaty right now.

00:03:20.040 --> 00:03:21.500
I probably stink.

00:03:29.920 --> 00:03:31.580
It doesn't bother me.

00:03:34.380 --> 00:03:36.580
But I said it's no biggie.

00:03:36.960 --> 00:03:37.420
<b>Ba-dump</b>

00:03:36.960 --> 00:03:37.420
<b>ba-dump</b>

00:03:36.960 --> 00:03:37.420
<b>ba-dump...</b>

00:03:37.500 --> 00:03:40.170
The way she closed the gap
between us is bad for my heart.

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:38.420
<b>Ba-dump</b>

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:38.420
<b>ba-dump</b>

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:38.420
<b>ba-dump...</b>

00:03:39.080 --> 00:03:39.540
<b>Ba-dump</b>

00:03:39.080 --> 00:03:39.540
<b>ba-dump</b>

00:03:39.090 --> 00:03:39.540
<b>ba-dump...</b>

00:03:39.960 --> 00:03:40.420
<b>Ba-dump</b>

00:03:39.960 --> 00:03:40.420
<b>ba-dump</b>

00:03:39.960 --> 00:03:40.420
<b>ba-dump...</b>

00:03:40.460 --> 00:03:41.170
That's it!

00:03:42.500 --> 00:03:43.580
Wait just a sec!

00:03:47.670 --> 00:03:51.630
Kubo-san smells nice even after gym class.

00:03:53.960 --> 00:03:57.330
Her hair was up in a ponytail.
It really changed her look.

00:03:58.880 --> 00:04:03.630
<b>Attack: 80</b>

00:04:01.290 --> 00:04:02.960
Her power levels are off the charts.

00:04:02.130 --> 00:04:03.630
<b>Attack: 120</b>

00:04:04.040 --> 00:04:06.130
If I changed my hairstyle,

00:04:06.630 --> 00:04:09.750
<b>Background character A</b>

00:04:06.920 --> 00:04:09.040
I'd only look like a different background character.

00:04:08.630 --> 00:04:09.750
<b>Background character B</b>

00:04:10.040 --> 00:04:11.380
Kubo-san is phenomenal.

00:04:11.710 --> 00:04:12.380
Boo!

00:04:11.960 --> 00:04:12.380
<b>Press</b>

00:04:12.380 --> 00:04:13.040
Aah!

00:04:14.920 --> 00:04:16.170
Great reaction!

00:04:17.830 --> 00:04:20.880
If you wipe your sweat off with this,
you won't need to worry if you smell, right?

00:04:21.790 --> 00:04:22.580
Here ya go!

00:04:23.250 --> 00:04:24.250
Thanks.

00:04:24.670 --> 00:04:25.670
No problem.

00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:31.830
Um, why are you staring at me like that?

00:04:32.210 --> 00:04:34.670
Oh, it's just...

00:04:35.130 --> 00:04:37.750
Now we smell the same.

00:04:39.130 --> 00:04:40.380
We match.

00:04:42.080 --> 00:04:44.710
Kubocchi! Let's go change now.

00:04:45.130 --> 00:04:46.920
Yeah, okay!

00:04:48.040 --> 00:04:49.710
Later, Shiraishi-kun.

00:04:51.460 --> 00:04:52.630
The same...

00:05:25.580 --> 00:05:28.580
Hey, Kubocchi, you're grinning.

00:05:28.580 --> 00:05:30.460
Did something good happen?

00:05:30.670 --> 00:05:32.330
Hmm, what could it be?

00:05:32.330 --> 00:05:34.380
It's not cool to keep secrets.

00:05:34.380 --> 00:05:36.130
Hey, it's not like that.

00:05:36.380 --> 00:05:38.210
Kubocchi, gimme a wipe.

00:05:38.580 --> 00:05:39.250
Huh?

00:05:42.920 --> 00:05:44.250
Not today!

00:05:44.420 --> 00:05:46.830
What? But you always let me have some!

00:05:47.330 --> 00:05:50.330
Do those have anything to do with your chipper mood?

00:05:53.540 --> 00:05:55.130
Nope, not at all.

00:05:55.880 --> 00:05:57.460
She's so easy to read.

00:05:57.750 --> 00:05:59.580
Kubocchi, you meanie!

00:06:22.130 --> 00:06:26.250
It's finally the day I've been waiting for:
the release date of Sword x Magic's latest volume!

00:06:29.040 --> 00:06:29.960
I'm heading out!

00:06:32.170 --> 00:06:33.670
Be safe!

00:06:36.380 --> 00:06:38.920
<b>Books</b>

00:06:36.380 --> 00:06:38.920
<b>Shueido</b>

00:06:36.380 --> 00:06:38.920
<b>Bookstore</b>

00:06:41.830 --> 00:06:42.630
Huh?

00:06:42.790 --> 00:06:45.000
<b>Books</b>

00:06:42.790 --> 00:06:45.000
<b>Shueido Bookstore</b>

00:06:43.040 --> 00:06:44.210
Shiraishi-kun!

00:06:48.500 --> 00:06:50.000
Sneak, sneak.

00:06:50.000 --> 00:06:59.500
<b>Books</b>

00:06:50.000 --> 00:06:59.500
<b>Shueido Bookstore</b>

00:06:50.290 --> 00:06:51.420
Tap, tap, tap...

00:06:51.420 --> 00:06:53.540
The automatic door won't open for him.

00:06:53.540 --> 00:06:55.420
That's how the cookie crumbles sometimes.

00:06:55.500 --> 00:06:56.790
Whoosh, whoosh, whoosh...

00:06:56.790 --> 00:06:57.420
Oh!

00:06:57.670 --> 00:06:59.500
Ah, something caught his attention.

00:06:59.500 --> 00:07:03.000
<b>Automatic</b>

00:06:59.500 --> 00:07:03.000
<b>Please</b>

00:06:59.500 --> 00:07:03.000
<b>touch</b>

00:06:59.500 --> 00:07:03.000
<b>lightly</b>

00:07:00.040 --> 00:07:03.000
Ah! It's the push-button kind.

00:07:03.290 --> 00:07:04.750
That's embarrassing.

00:07:06.130 --> 00:07:08.130
Oh, let's pop into that bookstore.

00:07:08.130 --> 00:07:08.960
Good idea.

00:07:08.960 --> 00:07:10.580
Oh, a couple is coming up behind him!

00:07:10.580 --> 00:07:11.460
...wonder if it's out.

00:07:11.460 --> 00:07:13.080
I don't know.

00:07:14.710 --> 00:07:15.380
Oh!

00:07:17.670 --> 00:07:21.040
Oh, he should've gone in while the door was still open.

00:07:21.040 --> 00:07:23.380
That sucks, Shiraishi-kun.

00:07:24.630 --> 00:07:26.330
Shiraishi-kun isn't backing down.

00:07:35.920 --> 00:07:37.960
Oh! It opened.

00:07:39.000 --> 00:07:40.040
Kubo-san's so close!

00:07:40.670 --> 00:07:41.380
Oh my.

00:07:42.920 --> 00:07:44.460
Hiya, Shiraishi-kun.

00:07:45.080 --> 00:07:46.210
You were in quite a pickle.

00:07:46.210 --> 00:07:48.460
H-how long have you been watching?

00:07:48.460 --> 00:07:50.420
Does that always happen to you?

00:07:51.170 --> 00:07:52.710
Not always.

00:07:54.040 --> 00:07:57.080
But no automatic doors open for me on the first try.

00:07:57.830 --> 00:08:01.170
Those doors were just especially
unresponsive to me today.

00:08:01.630 --> 00:08:02.830
I gotcha.

00:08:06.420 --> 00:08:08.790
So, what did you come here to buy?

00:08:08.790 --> 00:08:09.540
Ah!

00:08:15.710 --> 00:08:18.460
Shiraishi-kun seems so hyped.

00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:22.960
Today's the latest volume's release date,
and I've been dying to get my hands on it for so long.

00:08:23.330 --> 00:08:25.380
So I just had to buy it.

00:08:27.170 --> 00:08:28.790
What am I blabbing on about?

00:08:30.330 --> 00:08:31.460
I gotcha.

00:08:31.830 --> 00:08:33.830
You must love this manga series.

00:08:34.580 --> 00:08:36.040
That's really cool.

00:08:38.880 --> 00:08:40.460
You're like a bobblehead.

00:08:41.170 --> 00:08:42.500
I wanna try reading it.

00:08:43.830 --> 00:08:45.040
They don't have the first volume!

00:08:47.500 --> 00:08:48.670
That sucks.

00:08:49.920 --> 00:08:50.750
I know!

00:08:51.040 --> 00:08:53.250
I can borrow it from you!

00:08:53.500 --> 00:08:56.000
Um, Kubo-san...

00:08:56.000 --> 00:08:57.290
Are you not okay with that?

00:08:57.920 --> 00:08:59.000
I'm fine with it.

00:08:59.380 --> 00:09:01.250
Nice! Thank you!

00:09:06.500 --> 00:09:21.500
<b>Books          Shueido Bookstore</b>

00:09:07.130 --> 00:09:10.290
Don't forget to bring the manga
with you to school tomorrow, okay?

00:09:10.670 --> 00:09:11.540
Okay.

00:09:12.580 --> 00:09:14.330
Well, I live this way.

00:09:15.380 --> 00:09:17.210
I gotta go the same direction too.

00:09:17.210 --> 00:09:18.630
Do you live near here?

00:09:19.040 --> 00:09:21.380
Uh, about five minutes away.

00:09:21.710 --> 00:09:22.880
Really?

00:09:22.880 --> 00:09:24.960
Then let's swing by your place now.

00:09:27.080 --> 00:09:28.380
Shiraishi-kun.

00:09:29.000 --> 00:09:30.630
Just so I can borrow your manga.

00:09:32.500 --> 00:09:34.460
Pick up the pace!

00:09:36.540 --> 00:09:39.330
That's right. Just for the manga.

00:09:42.880 --> 00:09:43.790
Here you go.

00:09:44.790 --> 00:09:46.580
I'm lending you three volumes to start with.

00:09:47.080 --> 00:09:50.130
If you decide you want to continue reading
the series, I'll lend you more.

00:09:50.670 --> 00:09:52.670
Okay. Thank you!

00:09:55.880 --> 00:09:57.750
Well, this is a surprise.

00:09:57.920 --> 00:10:00.330
I had no idea our houses are so close.

00:10:00.750 --> 00:10:02.710
We're like five minutes away from my house.

00:10:03.250 --> 00:10:04.710
Oh, okay.

00:10:05.080 --> 00:10:06.460
Hey, Shiraishi-kun.

00:10:07.420 --> 00:10:10.920
About what time do you leave
your house to go to school?

00:10:11.210 --> 00:10:13.960
Hmm, at about eight, I guess.

00:10:14.250 --> 00:10:16.580
Oh, you leave a little earlier than me.

00:10:16.880 --> 00:10:19.420
That's why we never run into
each other on the way to school.

00:10:19.880 --> 00:10:21.170
Why do you ask?

00:10:21.790 --> 00:10:22.830
No reason!

00:10:23.250 --> 00:10:24.500
Thanks for the manga.

00:10:24.500 --> 00:10:26.080
See you tomorrow at school!

00:10:26.380 --> 00:10:27.080
Yeah.

00:10:33.330 --> 00:10:37.000
Maybe I'll try leaving for school a little earlier tomorrow.

00:10:39.040 --> 00:10:43.040
<b>Sword</b>

00:10:39.040 --> 00:10:43.040
<b>x</b>

00:10:39.040 --> 00:10:43.040
<b>Magic</b>

00:11:18.330 --> 00:11:19.290
Umph.

00:11:29.290 --> 00:11:31.540
Do I switch it up with pigtails?

00:11:32.500 --> 00:11:33.670
A ponytail?

00:11:34.880 --> 00:11:37.250
Or a slightly more mature half updo?

00:11:37.710 --> 00:11:41.250
Hmm... Does it look like I'm trying too hard?

00:11:41.460 --> 00:11:42.170
Oh.

00:11:43.080 --> 00:11:45.080
My sister's hair mist.

00:11:47.210 --> 00:11:48.290
It smells nice.

00:11:56.710 --> 00:11:58.250
Good morning, Akina.

00:11:59.290 --> 00:12:00.710
Good morning, Nagisa.

00:12:01.670 --> 00:12:04.040
Huh? You're up earlier than usual.

00:12:04.040 --> 00:12:05.210
Where's mom?

00:12:05.210 --> 00:12:06.580
She's on the morning shift.

00:12:07.750 --> 00:12:10.460
Oh, okay. It's Monday today, right?

00:12:11.380 --> 00:12:12.750
Thanks for making breakfast!

00:12:16.290 --> 00:12:18.170
Is something special happening at school today?

00:12:18.580 --> 00:12:20.080
No, not really.

00:12:21.290 --> 00:12:23.580
Really?

00:12:25.500 --> 00:12:27.630
What is it? You're weirding me out.

00:12:27.630 --> 00:12:31.210
Nothing, I was just thinking about how cute you are.

00:12:31.210 --> 00:12:33.080
I doubt that.

00:12:33.670 --> 00:12:35.290
I'm telling the truth.

00:12:36.670 --> 00:12:39.920
For example, you said nothing's going on at school,

00:12:41.460 --> 00:12:45.130
but you used my expensive hair mist.

00:12:45.130 --> 00:12:46.750
I find that adorable.

00:12:48.750 --> 00:12:50.420
Do you have a crush?

00:12:53.380 --> 00:12:54.960
No. Definitely not.

00:12:56.830 --> 00:12:57.630
M'kay.

00:12:57.630 --> 00:12:58.460
My, oh, my.

00:12:58.460 --> 00:12:59.500
I gotta go now!

00:13:01.000 --> 00:13:02.420
Hold on.

00:13:03.330 --> 00:13:06.080
You always leave ten minutes later.

00:13:06.080 --> 00:13:08.630
No need to rush out the door.

00:13:08.960 --> 00:13:12.460
After all, it's an ordinary day, right?

00:13:17.130 --> 00:13:17.710
<b>Pfft</b>

00:13:18.960 --> 00:13:21.580
Your face is an open book, Nagisa!

00:13:22.210 --> 00:13:23.380
Akina!

00:13:25.000 --> 00:13:26.460
That was a hoot!

00:13:27.380 --> 00:13:29.000
Hopefully he notices.

00:13:29.500 --> 00:13:31.130
Ugh! I'm leaving!

00:13:32.210 --> 00:13:33.250
Have a good day!

00:13:36.420 --> 00:13:39.880
Maybe I'll take her to look at beauty products sometime.

00:13:40.710 --> 00:13:42.460
Cause I'm a such a good sister.

00:13:52.170 --> 00:13:53.330
Guess I still need to wait.

00:13:53.580 --> 00:13:54.920
Oh! There he is!

00:14:05.670 --> 00:14:06.580
Oh!

00:14:07.500 --> 00:14:08.960
Shiraishi-kun.

00:14:10.330 --> 00:14:11.130
Good morning.

00:14:12.880 --> 00:14:13.790
Good morning.

00:14:19.420 --> 00:14:21.250
Sure enough, he didn't notice.

00:14:24.960 --> 00:14:26.080
What's wrong?

00:14:29.750 --> 00:14:31.750
Nah, it's nothing.

00:14:40.080 --> 00:14:43.170
This is the first time I've walked
to school with a classmate.

00:14:43.920 --> 00:14:47.750
Since elementary school,
I've always went to school alone.

00:14:50.080 --> 00:14:53.080
Not that it really matters though.

00:14:55.130 --> 00:14:57.880
We still got some time, so why don't we chat a little?

00:14:59.040 --> 00:15:00.540
Huh? Here?

00:15:00.830 --> 00:15:01.670
Yeah.

00:15:05.420 --> 00:15:06.670
Wanna sit?

00:15:06.670 --> 00:15:07.380
Huh?

00:15:08.630 --> 00:15:09.540
Okay.

00:15:19.420 --> 00:15:22.630
What do people talk about in situations like this?

00:15:24.210 --> 00:15:25.380
Shiraishi-kun.

00:15:26.290 --> 00:15:27.420
Yeah? What?

00:15:27.710 --> 00:15:29.540
Is that where you buy lunch?

00:15:30.130 --> 00:15:32.380
Yeah, but not every day.

00:15:32.380 --> 00:15:33.670
Ah, okay.

00:15:35.420 --> 00:15:37.750
Do you like sweets?

00:15:38.210 --> 00:15:39.080
Why?

00:15:39.830 --> 00:15:41.920
Because you bought an anpan sweet roll the other day.

00:15:42.420 --> 00:15:47.580
Oh. I hadn't thought about it before,
but I don't dislike sweets.

00:15:50.170 --> 00:15:51.250
I gotcha.

00:15:54.880 --> 00:15:57.210
The early bird really does get the worm.

00:15:57.210 --> 00:15:59.540
Huh? What worm did you get?

00:16:00.750 --> 00:16:01.670
Well...

00:16:02.040 --> 00:16:03.460
Nagisa, good morning!

00:16:04.210 --> 00:16:05.170
Good morning!

00:16:06.080 --> 00:16:08.170
Kubocchi, Hazuki, good morning!

00:16:09.210 --> 00:16:10.210
Good morning!

00:16:11.460 --> 00:16:13.080
This is literally the worst!

00:16:13.080 --> 00:16:16.250
I accidently put my socks on inside out.

00:16:16.250 --> 00:16:17.580
I'm totally embarrassed!

00:16:18.250 --> 00:16:20.790
It's rare for Nagisa to be the first one here, right?

00:16:21.250 --> 00:16:25.710
Yeah, I woke up a little earlier today.
And then, I ran into Shiraishi-kun by chance.

00:16:25.710 --> 00:16:26.960
Shiraishi?

00:16:26.960 --> 00:16:28.210
Yeah, Shiraishi-kun.

00:16:29.170 --> 00:16:30.540
Woah, Shiraishi!

00:16:30.540 --> 00:16:32.170
Oh my gosh! He was here?

00:16:32.380 --> 00:16:33.710
Y-yep.

00:16:34.250 --> 00:16:36.830
We always meet up here.

00:16:37.290 --> 00:16:38.000
Huh?

00:16:38.540 --> 00:16:40.080
Me, Hazuki, and Tama.

00:16:41.170 --> 00:16:41.920
Oh.

00:16:42.750 --> 00:16:44.380
Well, I'm going to go on ahead.

00:16:51.540 --> 00:16:54.040
Nagisa, I'm impressed you spotted him.

00:16:54.420 --> 00:16:56.330
Y-yeah, I sure did.

00:16:56.670 --> 00:17:01.130
Maybe fortune is smiling on us today.
What should I do? Maybe roll gacha?

00:17:05.630 --> 00:17:11.080
Just because someone happened to walk to school
with me doesn't mean the rest of my day is any different.

00:17:12.380 --> 00:17:18.000
No one sees me. No one makes eye contact with me.
No one is aware of my existence.

00:17:18.500 --> 00:17:20.460
Today will end up being just like every other day.

00:17:33.250 --> 00:17:34.500
<b>Quick</b>

00:17:33.630 --> 00:17:35.000
Yep. It's the same old, same old.

00:17:36.170 --> 00:17:36.630
Huh?

00:17:40.460 --> 00:17:42.710
Okay, so it's not the same old, same old.

00:17:43.750 --> 00:17:47.000
This is embarrassing as all get-out,
but normally when I'm walking,

00:17:47.000 --> 00:17:48.880
I'm not noticed by the people around me.

00:17:50.040 --> 00:17:53.420
During situations like this, I'm glad I'm invisible.

00:17:53.420 --> 00:17:55.000
Shiraishi-kun.

00:17:56.500 --> 00:17:58.080
Oh, that voice...

00:18:00.170 --> 00:18:01.580
I saw that.

00:18:01.580 --> 00:18:04.080
Kubo-san found me.

00:18:04.500 --> 00:18:05.960
Talk about bad luck.

00:18:05.960 --> 00:18:08.460
You gotta get home and shower, pronto.

00:18:09.710 --> 00:18:11.080
You got that right.

00:18:11.080 --> 00:18:15.790
I'm covered in mud, and Kubo-san saw me.
What rotten luck!

00:18:18.460 --> 00:18:21.210
Well then, get home safe, Kubo-san.

00:18:21.210 --> 00:18:21.920
Yeah.

00:18:22.580 --> 00:18:23.830
See you later, Shiraishi-kun!

00:18:24.210 --> 00:18:25.790
Yeah, see you tomorrow.

00:18:33.330 --> 00:18:34.130
Not there.

00:18:39.670 --> 00:18:40.380
Not here.

00:18:47.420 --> 00:18:48.880
Huh? Shiraishi-kun?!

00:18:51.330 --> 00:18:53.960
Um, Shiraishi-kun, is everything okay?

00:18:53.960 --> 00:18:54.790
Kubo-san!

00:18:56.250 --> 00:18:57.500
I forgot my key.

00:18:57.500 --> 00:18:58.830
What about your family?

00:18:59.630 --> 00:19:02.790
It looks like they're not home.
I'll try sending my mom a message on Pine.

00:19:03.130 --> 00:19:04.880
<b>When will you be back home?</b>

00:19:03.130 --> 00:19:04.880
<b>I forgot my key and can't get in</b>

00:19:06.670 --> 00:19:09.130
<b>Read</b>

00:19:06.670 --> 00:19:09.130
<b>Mom</b>

00:19:06.670 --> 00:19:09.130
<b>Goodness, what a predicament.</b>

00:19:06.670 --> 00:19:09.130
<b>I'll be home in about two hours</b>

00:19:06.670 --> 00:19:09.130
<b>so kill a little bit of time</b>

00:19:07.920 --> 00:19:08.920
Two hours...

00:19:10.460 --> 00:19:11.290
What're you gonna do?

00:19:11.710 --> 00:19:14.380
To start, I'll wash up at the park.

00:19:14.380 --> 00:19:16.750
What? But it's November! It'll be cold!

00:19:19.420 --> 00:19:20.420
Shiraishi-kun!

00:19:21.500 --> 00:19:22.290
Wanna come to my place?

00:19:23.830 --> 00:19:27.290
My house is closer than the park,
and that way, you can use hot water.

00:19:28.920 --> 00:19:30.460
Thanks, but that's okay.

00:19:30.460 --> 00:19:32.040
Oh, but your clothes...

00:19:33.380 --> 00:19:34.580
It'll be fine!

00:19:35.380 --> 00:19:36.830
As long as you're cool with it.

00:19:37.420 --> 00:19:39.880
I'm not asking her what will be fine.

00:19:43.330 --> 00:19:45.330
No one's home today, so it's okay.

00:19:45.670 --> 00:19:46.540
Really?

00:19:46.540 --> 00:19:47.750
Come on in!

00:19:48.380 --> 00:19:49.500
All right.

00:19:51.960 --> 00:19:52.880
It's this way.

00:19:54.670 --> 00:19:58.170
This is the bathroom. And the shampoo is...

00:20:00.670 --> 00:20:01.330
Oh!

00:20:04.750 --> 00:20:05.670
Did you see?

00:20:07.080 --> 00:20:08.080
See what?

00:20:08.500 --> 00:20:11.250
Er, I'll grab you a change of clothes.

00:20:11.500 --> 00:20:12.880
Go ahead and start your shower.

00:20:14.580 --> 00:20:15.290
Okay.

00:20:17.210 --> 00:20:18.960
So this is Kubo-san's bathroom.

00:20:21.960 --> 00:20:23.630
This is, well, awkward in all sorts of ways.

00:20:26.290 --> 00:20:27.880
Would a tracksuit be okay?

00:20:28.170 --> 00:20:29.880
It would probably fit at least.

00:20:30.580 --> 00:20:33.790
Oh, he definitely saw it! I'm so embarrassed!

00:20:44.000 --> 00:20:48.210
Shiraishi-kun, I put a change of clothes
and a towel on the washing machine.

00:20:48.880 --> 00:20:50.170
Okay, thanks.

00:21:07.290 --> 00:21:09.880
Um, thanks for letting me shower here.

00:21:10.630 --> 00:21:11.960
Don't mention it.

00:21:12.670 --> 00:21:15.830
Thanks for the tracksuit too. I'll wash it and return it.

00:21:16.130 --> 00:21:18.080
Also, where is my school uniform?

00:21:18.630 --> 00:21:20.750
I cleaned it and removed the most noticeable stains.

00:21:21.380 --> 00:21:22.080
Thank you.

00:21:23.920 --> 00:21:26.000
Oh, my mom's home now.

00:21:26.380 --> 00:21:28.130
Oh, okay, great!

00:21:28.130 --> 00:21:28.750
Yeah.

00:21:31.920 --> 00:21:32.790
Shiraishi-kun.

00:21:34.080 --> 00:21:37.460
Your hair is still wet.
You should dry it before heading home.

00:21:37.960 --> 00:21:39.210
Or you'll catch a cold.

00:21:40.630 --> 00:21:41.540
All right.

00:21:41.920 --> 00:21:42.460
Good boy.

00:21:48.580 --> 00:21:50.790
Okay then, get home safe.

00:21:51.080 --> 00:21:51.670
Okay.

00:21:52.330 --> 00:21:53.830
See you later, Shiraishi-kun.

00:21:54.130 --> 00:21:55.540
Yeah, see you later.

00:22:05.630 --> 00:22:09.670
Anyone would be hyperaware after something like that.
